   "source": [
    "# ManufacturingPolicyLab — 交互式政策沙盒 Demo\n",
    "\n",
    "本 Notebook 演示 1990–2020 年美国制造业自动化冲击的多主体政策沙盒。\n",
    "你可以通过下方滑块实时调整政府的三项政策杠杆，观察企业异质性（小 / 中 / 大）在不同政策环境下的就业、自动化、工资与失业率的演化路径。\n",
    "\n",
    "核心设计：\n",
    "- **探索环境**：1990–2020 年美国制造业宏观数据驱动的多主体仿真。\n",
    "- **发现信号**：失业率、总就业、自动化水平、工资基尼系数、政府预算。\n",
    "- **最小闭环**：政府政策 → 企业优化决策 → 劳动力市场结果 → 下一轮政策反馈。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import ipywidgets as widgets\n",
    "from IPython.display import display, clear_output\n",
    "\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(\"..\") / \"src\"))\n",
    "from model import ManufacturingModel\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams[\"font.sans-serif\"] = [\"Arial Unicode MS\", \"SimHei\"]\n",
    "plt.rcParams[\"axes.unicode_minus\"] = False"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 单场景交互式仿真\n",
    "\n",
    "拖动滑块设定政府的三项政策参数，然后点击 **Run Simulation** 运行一次 1990–2020 年的反事实仿真。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "u_slider = widgets.FloatSlider(value=0.4, min=0.0, max=0.8, step=0.05, description=\"失业替代率 u\")\n",
    "r_slider = widgets.FloatSlider(value=0.15, min=0.0, max=0.5, step=0.05, description=\"机器人税收抵免 r\")\n",
    "s_slider = widgets.FloatSlider(value=0.15, min=0.0, max=0.5, step=0.05, description=\"SME 补贴 s\")\n",
    "run_btn = widgets.Button(description=\"Run Simulation\", button_style=\"primary\")\n",
    "out = widgets.Output()\n",
    "\n",
    "def run_single(b):\n",
    "    out.clear_output(wait=True)\n",
    "    with out:\n",
    "        model = ManufacturingModel(scenario=\"free_market\", seed=42)\n",
    "        # 覆盖政府政策参数\n",
    "        model.gov.u = u_slider.value\n",
    "        model.gov.r = r_slider.value\n",
    "        model.gov.s = s_slider.value\n",
    "        model_df, agent_df = model.run()\n",
    "        \n",
    "        fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(12, 8))\n",
    "        axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "        axes[0].plot(model_df[\"year\"], model_df[\"total_automation\"], label=\"Avg automation\")\n",
    "        axes[0].set_title(\"Automation Intensity\")\n",
    "        axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Year\")\n",
    "        axes[0].set_ylabel(\"Automation index\")\n",
    "        axes[0].legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "        axes[1].plot(model_df[\"year\"], model_df[\"total_employment\"] / 1e6, color=\"tab:green\")\n",
    "        axes[1].set_title(\"Total Manufacturing Employment\")\n",
    "        axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Year\")\n",
    "        axes[1].set_ylabel(\"Millions\")\n",
    "\n",
    "        axes[2].plot(model_df[\"year\"], model_df[\"unemployment_rate\"] * 100, color=\"tab:red\")\n",
    "        axes[2].set_title(\"Unemployment Rate\")\n",
    "        axes[2].set_xlabel(\"Year\")\n",
    "        axes[2].set_ylabel(\"%\")\n",
    "\n",
    "        axes[3].plot(model_df[\"year\"], model_df[\"avg_wage\"], color=\"tab:purple\", label=\"Avg wage\")\n",
    "        axes[3].plot(model_df[\"year\"], model_df[\"gini\"], color=\"tab:orange\", label=\"Wage Gini\")\n",
    "        axes[3].set_title(\"Wage Level & Inequality\")\n",
    "        axes[3].set_xlabel(\"Year\")\n",
    "        axes[3].legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "        fig.suptitle(f\"Custom Policy: u={u_slider.value:.2f}, r={r_slider.value:.2f}, s={s_slider.value:.2f}\")\n",
    "        plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "        plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "        final = model_df.iloc[-1]\n",
    "        print(f\"2020 结果：就业 {final['total_employment']/1e6:.2f}M，失业率 {final['unemployment_rate']*100:.1f}%，\",\n",
    "              f\"自动化 {final['total_automation']:.2f}，平均工资 {final['avg_wage']:.2f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "run_btn.on_click(run_single)\n",
    "display(widgets.VBox([u_slider, r_slider, s_slider, run_btn, out]))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 三种政策情景对比\n",
    "\n",
    "下方同时运行 **自由市场**、**温和干预**、**强力干预** 三种政策，直观比较 30 年演化轨迹。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "scenarios = {\"free_market\": \"Free Market\", \"moderate\": \"Moderate Policy\", \"aggressive\": \"Aggressive Policy\"}\n",
    "palette = {\"free_market\": \"tab:blue\", \"moderate\": \"tab:orange\", \"aggressive\": \"tab:green\"}\n",
    "results = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "for scen in scenarios:\n",
    "    model = ManufacturingModel(scenario=scen, seed=42)\n",
    "    model_df, _ = model.run()\n",
    "    results[scen] = model_df\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(12, 8))\n",
    "axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "\n",
    "for scen, label in scenarios.items():\n",
    "    df = results[scen]\n",
    "    color = palette[scen]\n",
    "    axes[0].plot(df[\"year\"], df[\"total_automation\"], label=label, color=color)\n",
    "    axes[1].plot(df[\"year\"], df[\"total_employment\"] / 1e6, label=label, color=color)\n",
    "    axes[2].plot(df[\"year\"], df[\"unemployment_rate\"] * 100, label=label, color=color)\n",
    "    axes[3].plot(df[\"year\"], df[\"avg_wage\"], label=label, color=color)\n",
    "\n",
    "titles = [\"Automation Intensity\", \"Total Employment (M)\", \"Unemployment Rate (% )\", \"Average Wage\"]\n",
    "for ax, title in zip(axes, titles):\n",
    "    ax.set_title(title)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel(\"Year\")\n",
    "    ax.legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "fig.suptitle(\"Policy Scenario Comparison: 1990–2020\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 生成政策对比动画（GIF）\n",
    "\n",
    "运行本单元格将在 `../figures/policy_comparison.gif` 生成一张动态对比图，可用于答辩演示或嵌入文档。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from matplotlib.animation import FuncAnimation\n",
    "from matplotlib import rc\n",
    "\n",
    "# 准备数据\n",
    "scenario_data = {}\n",
    "for scen in scenarios:\n",
    "    model = ManufacturingModel(scenario=scen, seed=42)\n",
    "    model_df, _ = model.run()\n",
    "    scenario_data[scen] = model_df\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(12, 8))\n",
    "axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "lines = {}\n",
    "dots = {}\n",
    "for scen, label in scenarios.items():\n",
    "    color = palette[scen]\n",
    "    lines[scen] = [ax.plot([], [], color=color, label=label)[0] for ax in axes]\n",
    "    dots[scen] = [ax.plot([], [], \"o\", color=color)[0] for ax in axes]\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, title in zip(axes, titles):\n",
    "    ax.set_title(title)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel(\"Year\")\n",
    "    ax.set_xlim(1990, 2020)\n",
    "    ax.legend(loc=\"upper left\")\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylim(0, 1.05)\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylim(0, 20)\n",
    "axes[2].set_ylim(0, 70)\n",
    "axes[3].set_ylim(0, 15)\n",
    "\n",
    "def init():\n",
    "    for scen in scenarios:\n",
    "        for line in lines[scen]:\n",
    "            line.set_data([], [])\n",
    "        for dot in dots[scen]:\n",
    "            dot.set_data([], [])\n",
    "    return [item for scen in scenarios for item in lines[scen] + dots[scen]]\n",
    "\n",
    "def update(frame):\n",
    "    for scen in scenarios:\n",
    "        df = scenario_data[scen]\n",
    "        x = df[\"year\"].values[:frame+1]\n",
    "        y_list = [\n",
    "            df[\"total_automation\"].values[:frame+1],\n",
    "            df[\"total_employment\"].values[:frame+1] / 1e6,\n",
    "            df[\"unemployment_rate\"].values[:frame+1] * 100,\n",
    "            df[\"avg_wage\"].values[:frame+1],\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "        for i, (line, dot, y) in enumerate(zip(lines[scen], dots[scen], y_list)):\n",
    "            line.set_data(x, y)\n",
    "            dot.set_data([x[-1]], [y[-1]])\n",
    "    year_text.set_text(f\"Year: {1990 + frame}\")\n",
    "    return [year_text] + [item for scen in scenarios for item in lines[scen] + dots[scen]]\n",
    "\n",
    "year_text = fig.text(0.5, 0.02, \"\", ha=\"center\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "ani = FuncAnimation(fig, update, frames=len(scenario_data[\"free_market\"]), init_func=init, blit=False)\n",
    "gif_path = Path(\"..\") / \"figures\" / \"policy_comparison.gif\"\n",
    "ani.save(gif_path, writer=\"pillow\", fps=4)\n",
    "plt.close(fig)\n",
    "print(f\"Saved animation to {gif_path}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 发现信号检查清单\n",
    "\n",
    "| 信号 | 含义 | 本模型观测指标 |\n",
    "|------|------|----------------|\n",
    "| 失业激增 | 自动化替代速度超过劳动力转移速度 | `unemployment_rate` |\n",
    "| 工资极化 | 大企业工资溢价扩大，小企业被挤压 | `gini`, `avg_wage` by `size_class` |\n",
    "| 自动化跃迁 | 企业 automation index 快速趋近 1 | `total_automation` |\n",
    "| 政策可持续 | 政府预算不出现持续赤字 | `budget`, `deficit_rounds` |\n",
    "\n",
    "通过调节 `u / r / s`，你可以找到一组政策组合，使上述信号同时处于可接受区间。"
   ]
  }
 ],
